title: "open-model-phylogeny: a phylogenetic analysis of the Hugging Face Hub"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline, results and figures for a phylogenetic analysis of the
  Hugging Face Hub, built from the lineage that models declare: fine-tunes,
  adapters, quantisations and merges.
